(64,-1887842543,'Created page with \"= DD Form 175 — Military Flight Plan =  \'\'How to file a military flight plan for your virtual squadron\'\'  {{toc}}  == 1. Overview ==  The DD Form 175 is the standard US military domestic flight plan. Every mission—regardless of aircraft type or complexity—is filed on this form before departure. Base Operations reviews and approves it; one copy stays with base ops, one flies with the crew.  The form has four logical parts: a \'\'\'document header\'\'\' that identifies the...\"',NULL),
