(70,2133002605,'Created page with \"{{DISPLAYTITLE:Filing a DoD International Flight Plan (DD Form 1801)}} [[Category:Procedures]] [[Category:Navigation]] [[Category:Pilot Resources]]  = Filing a DoD International Flight Plan (DD Form 1801) =  This article explains how to correctly fill out the DD Form 1801 / ICAO FPL message used for all cross-border and controlled airspace operations. Read this before filing your first plan — a malformed FPL will be rejected by ATC and may delay or ground your flight....\"',NULL),
