(95,955191714,'Created page with \"== FENCE IN / FENCE OUT == A FENCE check is performed when entering (FENCE IN) or exiting (FENCE OUT) a hostile or combat area. It ensures all aircraft systems are configured for combat before the Timeline begins.   === F-16 FENCE IN === {| class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;\" !# !Item !Action |- |1 |Lights |As required (master off or as briefed) |- |2 |AVTR/DVR |As required |- |3 |COMM / MSL / RWR Volume |As desired |- |4 |ECM |As briefed |- |5 |Stores Config switch |C...\"',NULL),
