(129,1596646635,'Created page with \"== 08 / Air-to-Air Combat == [[MTTP/A2A|Air to Air Communication Procedures]]  Air combat is primarily carried out by CAP aircraft. The two main mission types are \'\'\'DCA\'\'\' (Defensive Counter Air) and \'\'\'OCA\'\'\' (Offensive Counter Air).  === Groups and Contacts === A \'\'\'GROUP\'\'\' is any number of air contacts within 3 nm in azimuth and range of each other. A \'\'\'CONTACT\'\'\' is an individual radar return within a GROUP. Single contact is the assumed strength for all GROUPs un...\"',NULL),
