('US_Navy_030125-N-0905V-002_S-3B_\'Viking_assigned_to_the_Screwbirds_of_Sea_Control_Squadron_33_(VS-33)_.jpg',1599031,2000,1312,'{\"data\":{\"iimVersion\":2,\"ObjectName\":[\"030125-N-0905V-002\"],\"iimCategory\":[\"N\"],\"iimSupplementalCategory\":[\"navynewsphoto@hq.navy.mil\",\"PH(202)685-6687/Fax 6692\",\"UNCLASSIFIED\"],\"Keywords\":[\"aircraft\",\"cvn 70\",\"cvw-9\",\"refueling\",\"s-3b\",\"screwbirds\",\"USS Carl Vinson\",\"viking\",\"vs-33\"],\"SpecialInstructions\":[\"Image CLEARED FOR PUBLIC RELEASE by LCDR Bob Meeker, Photo Officer, USS Carl Vinson (CVN 70).  credit as U.S. Navy photo by Chris M. Valdez\"],\"Artist\":[\"U.S. Navy Photo, Chris M. Valdez\"],\"CityDest\":[\"USS Carl Vinson (CVN 70)\"],\"OriginalTransmissionRef\":[\"VS-33\"],\"Source\":[\"Navy Visual News Service\"],\"ImageDescription\":[\"030125-N-0905V-002\\rAt sea with USS Carl Vinson (Jan. 25, 2003) -- An S-3B ÔVikingÓ assigned to the \\\"Screwbirds\\\" of Sea Control Squadron Three Three (VS-33) prepares to refuel during flight operations.  The ÒVikingÓ serves as the in-flight refueling platform for the embarked Carrier Air Wing (CVW-9).  Carl Vinson and CVW-9 are currently underway in the Southern Pacific Ocean conducting training missions in preparation for their next scheduled deployment.  U.S. Navy photo by Photographer\'s Mate Airman Chris M. Valdez.  (RELEASED)\"],\"Writer\":[\"LCDR P. Jensen, Dep. Director NV\"],\"MEDIAWIKI_EXIF_VERSION\":2}}',8,'BITMAP','image','jpeg',180,24,'20260619150843','b16qmbwgs19mifqvmpp84wtssrnjj43'),
