('en','messages:anoneditwarning','s:270:\"en:<strong>Warning:</strong> You are not logged in. Your IP address will be publicly visible if you make any edits. If you <strong>[$1 log in]</strong> or <strong>[$2 create an account]</strong>, your edits will be attributed to your username, along with other benefits.\";'),
