('en','messages:autoblockedtext','s:589:\"en:Your IP address has been automatically blocked because it was used by another user, who was blocked by $1.\nThe reason given is:\n\n:<em>$2</em>.\n\n*{{int:blockedtext-start-time|$8}}\n*{{int:blockedtext-expiration-time|$6}}\n*{{int:blockedtext-intended-blockee|$7}}\n\n{{int:blockedtext-contact-blocker-admin|$1}}\n\nYou can use the \"{{int:emailuser}}\" feature if a valid email address is specified in your [[Special:Preferences|preferences]] and you have not been blocked from using it.\n\n{{int:blockedtext-block-ip|$3}} {{int:blockedtext-block-id|$5}}\n{{int:blockedtext-include-details-queries}}\";'),
