(39,'ddform175',' ddu800 form 175u800 u8e28094 military flight plan  howu800 tou800 file au800 military flight plan  file au800 flight plan 1u800. overview 1u800. overview 1u800. overview theu800 ddu800 form 175u800 isu800 theu800 standard usu800 military domestic flight plan. every missionu8e28094regardless ofu800 aircraft type oru800 complexityu8e28094is filed onu800 this form before departure. base operations reviews andu800 approves itu800; theu800 form hasu800 four logical parts au800  document header  that identifies theu800 aircraft andu800 date oneu800 oru800 more  route legu800 rows  covering theu800 actual routing anu800  administrative section  foru800 fuel weather andu800 remarks andu800 au800  crew manifest . style \"border left 4pxu800 solid #36cu800; background #eefu800; padding 8pxu800; width 100u800 ;\"  note   inu800 theu800 virtual squadron digital form required fields areu800 marked with au800 redu800 asterisk * . 2u800. before youu800 start 2u800. before youu800 start 2u800. before youu800 start ; step 1u800 u8e28094 getu800 your weather brief obtain au800 weather briefing andu800 note theu800 source andu800 time zulu . youu800 will enter this inu800 field 18u800. example lsu800 18u800 local brief atu800 1800z . ; step 2u800 u8e28094 plan your route determine departure fixu800 airways intermediate fixes andu800 destination. note anyu800 refueling anchors suau800 transits oru800 holding requirements. allu800 icao identifiers areu800 4u800 letter codes eu800u82egu800. klsf . ; step 3u800 u8e28094 compute fuel andu800 eteu800 calculate estimated time enu800 route andu800 total fuel endurance inu800 hu800 mmu800 format eu800u82egu800. 2u800 30u800 2u800 hours 30u800 minutes . this isu800 dodu800 standard u8e28094 dou800 notu800 useu800 hhu800 mmu800 . ; step 4u800 u8e28094 check notams andu800 alternate review notams foru800 your route andu800 select anu800 alternate airfield required foru800 ifru800 . youu800 will check au800 boxu800 confirming notam review. 3u800. document header fields 1u8e280933 3u800. document header fields 1u8e280933 3u800. document header fields 1u8e280933 these three fields identify theu800 mission andu800 appear once atu800 theu800 topu800 ofu800 theu800 form. they apply tou800 every legu800. class \"wikitable\" field what tou800 enter status  field 1u800 u8e28094 date  date ofu800 flight inu800 ddu800 monu800 yyu800 format. example 24u800 apru800 26u800 . required  field 2u800 u8e28094 call sign  radio call sign foru800 this mission. example hawk 11u800 viper 07u800 . uppercase 4u8e2809312 characters. required  field 3u800 u8e28094 au800 cu800 designation  aircraft mdsu800 andu800 performance code inu800 type code format. example fu800 16cu800 bu800 hu800 cu800 17u800 ru800 . theu800 hu800 prefix denotes au800 heavy aircraft. required style \"border left 4pxu800 solid #36cu800; background #eefu800; padding 8pxu800; width 100u800 ;\"  note   theu800 authority field isu800 preu800 filled 10u800 uscu800 8012 andu800 eou800 9397 andu800 does notu800 need tou800 beu800 changed foru800 standard missions. 4u800. route ofu800 flight fields 4u8e2809311 4u800. route ofu800 flight fields 4u8e2809311 4u800. route ofu800 flight fields 4u8e2809311 each legu800 ofu800 theu800 flight occupies oneu800 rowu800. au800 direct flight hasu800 oneu800 legu800; au800 mission with au800 stopover oru800 multiple segments hasu800 multiple rows. click   addu800 legu800  inu800 theu800 form tou800 addu800 more rows. class \"wikitable\" field what tou800 enter status  field 4u800 u8e28094 type  flight rules foru800 this legu800 iu800 ifru800 vu800 vfru800 yu800 ifru800 then vfru800 zu800 vfru800 then ifru800 . required  field 5u800 u8e28094 tasu800  true airspeed inu800 knots integer nou800 unit suffix. examples 330u800 450u800 98u800 . required  field 6u800 u8e28094 departure  icao 4u800 letter identifier ofu800 theu800 departure airfield. example klsf kvad . foru800 legs originating from au800 fixu800 enter the