(4,'== Welcome to Source Wiki ==\nThe official knowledge base for Source DCS.\n\n== Categories ==\n* [[Guides|Flight Guides]]\n* [[Aircraft|Aircraft]]\n* [[Procedures|Procedures & SOPs]]\n* [[Units|Unit Structure]]\n\n== Recent Changes ==\n{{Special:RecentChanges}}','utf-8'),
