(473,'\n== \'\'\'Overview\'\'\' ==\nThe 14th Virtual Strike Fighter Squadron (VSFS) \"Top Hatters\" is a carrier-based F/A-18C strike fighter squadron deployed aboard the USS Harry S. Truman (CVN-75). The squadron takes its name, identity, and doctrine, from VFA-14 \"Top Hatters\": the US Navy\'s oldest continuously active squadron, founded in 1919 and known as \'\'\"The Oldest and the Boldest.\"\'\' 14th VSFS strives to honour that century-long legacy by upholding the professionalism, discipline, and tactical excellence of the real Top Hatters, with authentic US Navy carrier procedures adapted into all virtual operations','utf-8'),
