Formation Flying\n\nAir to Air Refueling\n\nFuel Management\n\nNight Flying\n\n\n\n\n== Resources and Files ==\n[https://polybox.ethz.ch/index.php/s/S8Es6KCzBao5WYm/download?path=%2FLiveries&files=14th%20VSFS%20Top%20Hatters%20HiVis%20V1.0-20260330T154252Z-3-001.zip 14th VSFS Standard Livery]\n\n[https://polybox.ethz.ch/index.php/s/S8Es6KCzBao5WYm/download?path=%2FKneeboards&files=FA-18C_hornet.rar 14th VSFS Kneeboard (Checklists + Quick Reference Guides + LTAG Aerodrome and Tacan Approach Charts)]\n\n[https://chucksguides.com/aircraft/dcs/fa-18c/ Chucks Guides - F/A-18C Hornet]\n\n[https://info.publicintelligence.net/F18-ABCD-000.pdf NATOPS FLIGHT MANUAL F/A-18A/B/C/D A1-F18AC-NFM-000] (Sept, 2008)\n\n[https://info.publicintelligence.net/F18-ABCD-000.pdf Eagle Dynamics F/A-18C Early Access Guide] (March, 2024)\n\n{{DEFAULTSORT:14th VSFS Top Hatters}}','utf-8'),
